      "results": [
        {
          "ruleId": "sunset/path_traversal",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "020.php 中 $_POST['include'] 直接拼入 <script src> 导致脚本来源可控（CWE-79/CWE-22 交叉）\n\n020.php:15 将 $_POST['include'] 原样拼接进 `<script src='\" . $_POST['include'] . \"'></script>`。攻击者可通过 POST 参数 include 指定任意外部脚本地址（如 https://attacker.example/x.js），或利用单引号闭合属性注入额外 HTML/JS。该处无 htmlspecialchars()、无 URL 白名单、无协议限制，校验完全缺失。严格来说这是输出编码/资源引用校验缺失问题，规则将其归为 path_traversal 属于推断；从代码事实看更接近可控脚本加载（可导致 XSS）。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "020.php"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 13,
                  "endLine": 15
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "sunsetFindingId": "GEN-dda61ef2bad8"
          },
          "properties": {
            "finding_id": "GEN-dda61ef2bad8",
            "confidence": 0.45,
            "verdict": "candidate",
            "evidence_level": "rule_verified+llm",
            "cwe": "CWE-22",
            "endpoint": "/020",
            "http_method": "POST",
            "has_poc": true,
            "origin": "rule"
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "sunset/client_side_validation",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "020.php 依赖客户端脚本加载，服务端缺少对应校验（CWE-602）\n\n020.php:14-15 将用户可控的 include 值作为外部 JavaScript 的 src 引入页面，安全判断实际交由客户端加载的脚本完成，服务端未对该值做任何重复校验或白名单比对。攻击者可直接构造 POST 请求绕过任何前端逻辑，因为服务端仅执行 isset 判断（020.php:13）。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "020.php"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 14,
                  "endLine": 15
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "sunsetFindingId": "SEM-cc52c467496c"
          },
          "properties": {
            "finding_id": "SEM-cc52c467496c",
            "confidence": 0.4,
            "verdict": "candidate",
            "evidence_level": "rule_verified+llm",
            "cwe": "CWE-602",
            "endpoint": "/020",
            "http_method": "POST",
            "has_poc": true,
            "origin": "rule"
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "sunset/xss",
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "020.php POST 参数 include 未编码直接拼入 <script src> 导致反射型 XSS（CSP 可被绕过）\n\n020.php 第 13-17 行读取 $_POST['include']，未做任何 HTML 实体编码或 URL 白名单校验，直接以单引号包裹拼接到 <script src='...'></script> 中并输出到响应体。攻击者可闭合单引号并注入任意 HTML/JS，例如 include='></script><script>alert(document.domain)</script> 或 include=x' onerror='alert(1)。虽然第 3-5 行设置了 CSP script-src 白名单，但该 CSP 允许 unpkg.com、cdn.jsdelivr.net、pastebin.com、hastebin.com 等可托管任意 JS 的域名（注释第 7-9 行亦明示），且注入点本身位于 script-src 允许的 inline 属性/标签上下文，攻击者可借助白名单 CDN 加载任意脚本，CSP 不构成有效防护。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "020.php"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 13,
                  "endLine": 17
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "partialFingerprints": {
